Hi {Owner},

I build websites and booking tools for HVAC companies around {City}. {Business Name} clearly runs a serious fleet, but the site still sends people to the phone to book a visit or join the maintenance plan, and every town you cover points to the same page.

I built a sample rather than ask for a meeting: booking by call type and arrival window, membership sign-up with recurring billing, a page per town tied to the branch that covers it, and a careers section for techs, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

It sits on top of your current scheduling system rather than replacing it. The build runs {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, changes and keeping the connections working.

Would twenty minutes with you and your ops lead be worth it this month?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
